  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Leo has a bag. \"Look in my bag,\" says Leo. \"What is it?\" asks Lily. \"It is a toy.\" \"Is it a doll?\" \"No.\" \"Is it a car?\" \"No!\" says Leo.",
      "\"Is it a kite?\" \"No.\" \"Is it a train?\" \"No, no.\" \"Is it a bike?\" \"No!\" says Leo. \"Is it a teddy?\" \"No,\" says Leo. \"Is it big?\" \"No, it is small.\" \"Do you know?\" asks Leo.",
      "\"Is it a robot?\" asks Lily. \"Yes!\" Leo has a small robot. Lily claps her hands. Pip says, \"Woof!\" Pip wants the robot. \"No, Pip!\" says Leo. Leo smiles."
    ],
    "summary": "Leo has a toy in his bag. Lily asks, \"Is it a doll? Is it a car?\" At last she asks, \"Is it a robot?\" and Leo says yes.",
